    "text": "wizmnews.com\nwebsite\nCrawford County, Wisconsin\nVenezuelan national convicted for attacking Crawford County residents, gets 2-year prison term\nBy Brad Williams,\n1 hours agoA man who came to Wisconsin from Venezuela to find work has been given a new prison sentence for crimes committed against people he has met in the state. In Crawford County court on Wednesday, Alejandro Coronel Zarate entered a negotiated plea on charges of strangulation and child abuse, and was ordered to serve 2 years in prison on each count, concurrently.",
